  name: Anemoia Pods
  type: Valuables
  section: Valuables
  description: The translucent, coin-round seed pods of the Anemoia Lunaria. Held up to the moon, each shows the faint shape of a life no one who holds it has lived. Rare and never used up, they are kept on shelves and windowsills as the most longed-for of ornaments, and every one is a seed that could still be planted.
